      "translation": {
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [],
        "english_text": "(The hut-dwellers scream and run in every direction. They fall.... Children are scorched in the fire. Chaos reigns. Vingan rescues those who have fallen into the flames. Kannaayiram too rescues people writhing in distress. Kokila and Maragatham run carrying the baby. Vingan unties the bull, gives it to Kannaayiram and sends him away to save it... Now Kokila is running alone with the baby. Maragatham is rescuing the poor people there from the fire.)"
      }
